#: ../../source/developer/architecture.rst:21
msgid "为什么要重写"
msgstr "Why rewrite"



#: ../../source/developer/architecture.rst:23
msgid "旧工程能玩，但 ``Theater``、``GameSession`` 变成了上帝类，数十个常量在 C# 与 JSON 之间手抄。OpenFoD 的选择是：**格式知识与行为测试留下，规则与客户端重写**。"
msgstr "The previous project plays, but ``Theater`` and ``GameSession`` became god classes, with dozens of constants hand-copied between C# and JSON. OpenFoD’s choice: **keep format knowledge and behavioural tests; rewrite rules and the client**."



#: ../../source/developer/architecture.rst:25
msgid "三条架构决策："
msgstr "Three architecture decisions:"



#: ../../source/developer/architecture.rst:27
#, fuzzy
msgid "**按层提取重写** (ADR 0001)：解码器不可再考古一遍，所以原样迁移后再清理；规则层推倒重做。"
msgstr "**Rewrite by extraction** (ADR 0001): decoders cannot be re-archaeologised, so they are moved then cleaned; the rules layer is rebuilt."



#: ../../source/developer/architecture.rst:28
#, fuzzy
msgid "**门禁先于游戏代码** (ADR 0002)：没有脚本守门的句子，不叫规则。"
msgstr "**Gates before game code** (ADR 0002): a sentence without a failing script is not a rule."



#: ../../source/developer/architecture.rst:29
#, fuzzy
