#: ../../source/developer/parity.rst:2
msgid "Parity 对照"
msgstr "Parity oracle"



#: ../../source/developer/parity.rst:4
msgid "规则层正在重写。旧工程保持可运行，是唯一完整的行为对照，所以它是 oracle。两套引擎不能链进同一个测试进程——类型同名会碰撞——而且旧测试套件编译的是旧接口。重写一旦开始，那些测试就不再能当规格。"
msgstr "The rules layer is being rewritten. The previous project stays runnable and is the only complete behavioural reference, so it is the oracle. The two engines cannot be linked into one test process — type names collide — and the old suite compiles against old interfaces. Once the rewrite starts, those tests cannot act as the spec."



#: ../../source/developer/parity.rst:6
msgid "做法（ADR 0005）：**不要链接两套引擎。分开驱动，对比 transcript。**"
msgstr "The method (ADR 0005): **do not link the engines. Drive them separately and compare transcripts.**"



#: ../../source/developer/parity.rst:15
msgid "约定"
msgstr "Contracts"



#: ../../source/developer/parity.rst:17
msgid "**场景是数据不是代码。** JSON 描述地图、刷兵、带时间戳的命令和要跑多久。场景里不出现 C# 类型名，这样架构重写不会毁掉规格。"
msgstr "**A scenario is data, not code.** JSON describes maps, spawns, tick-stamped commands and how long to run. No C# type names appear, so an architectural rewrite does not destroy the spec."



#: ../../source/developer/parity.rst:18
msgid "**Transcript 是规范投影。** 每个观察到的 tick 一条记录，单位按 id 排序，字段顺序固定，LF 换行，无时间戳。同一引擎跑两次必须字节级一致，否则 oracle 是噪声。"
msgstr "**A transcript is a canonical projection.** One record per observed tick, units sorted by id, fixed field order, LF line endings, no timestamps. Two runs of the same engine must be byte-identical, or the oracle is noise."



#: ../../source/developer/parity.rst:19
msgid "**Diff 必须写明容忍项。** 差异要么报出来，要么列出容忍理由。被容忍的差异是记录在案的分叉。"
msgstr "**A diff must name what it tolerates.** Differences are reported or listed with a reason. A tolerated difference is a recorded divergence."



#: ../../source/developer/parity.rst:20
msgid "两个 runner 只共享场景模型和 transcript 模型。"
msgstr "The two runners share the scenario and transcript model and nothing else."



#: ../../source/developer/parity.rst:22
msgid "``parity/`` 是过渡目录。等价性成立之后应当删除，而不是永远堆着两套世界。"
msgstr "``parity/`` is transitional. Delete it once equivalence is established; do not keep two worlds forever."



